POST {{base}}/api/AttendanceEvent/CheckIn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

EmployeeId={{e3}}&SourceChannel=GPS&Latitude=10.8233000&Longitude=106.6297000&ExternalEventId={{code}}-IN&Note=[DEMO] app chấm công

### 5.6 Gửi lại cùng ExternalEventId → isDuplicate = true, không ghi thêm
POST {{base}}/api/AttendanceEvent/CheckIn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

EmployeeId={{e3}}&SourceChannel=GPS&Latitude=10.8233000&Longitude=106.6297000&ExternalEventId={{code}}-IN

### 5.7 NV2 không có ca hôm nay → 400
POST {{base}}/api/AttendanceEvent/CheckIn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

EmployeeId={{e2}}&SourceChannel=MACHINE

### 5.8 Ra ca GPS cách ~ 1,1 km → vẫn ghi, isValid = false + cảnh báo "Ngoài bán kính"; về sớm
POST {{base}}/api/AttendanceEvent/CheckOut
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

EmployeeId={{e3}}&SourceChannel=GPS&Latitude=10.8331000&Longitude=106.6297000

### 5.9 Ra ca lần 2 → 400 (chưa vào ca nào)
POST {{base}}/api/AttendanceEvent/CheckOut
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

EmployeeId={{e3}}&SourceChannel=GPS&Latitude=10.8233000&Longitude=106.6297000

